path\\\":\\\"self.inventory.root\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":1}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Stopping ends the trial and releases its carried control; exposed slices are not treated as safe food.\\\",\\\"Root stock was last seen at tick 38, not confirmed current. Wren reported root nutrition 14 and toxicity 0; my own eating result will be new evidence.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Maintain an edible reserve without exhausting a patch.\\\",\\\"Report measured comparisons separately from preservation and safety claims.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"food-security\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can small food-handling trials inform reliable food storage while maintaining a dependable food reserve?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Whole-berry exposure previously showed equal decay gains for exposed and carried samples.\\\",\\\"At tick 65, after 11 rounds, sliced berry decay gain was 9.23314996 and carried whole control gain was 13.05985015; difference -3.82670019.\\\",\\\"Slices appeared shrivelled with no visible wetness and no rain rounds; water and mass were not measured.\\\",\\\"Slices were on ground while the whole control was carried, so form, location and handling differed.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Model decay readings are not microbial tests. Contamination, preservation and food safety remain unverified; current root stock is unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Maintain sufficient food while developing bounded, reproducible evidence about handling and storage.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned and performed whole-food exposure comparison.\\\",\\\"Learned thin-slice trial and prepared one berry with a stone edge and a carried control.\\\",\\\"Inspected slices and control after 11 rounds.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"A lower observed model decay gain in the sliced-ground sample than in the carried whole control, without an established safety or preservation conclusion.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Direct water or mass measurement, controlled handling comparisons, contamination assessment, and a replenished food reserve.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Stop this comparison, share its limitations, recover energy, gather roots if available, and observe personal consumption results.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The comparison supplies a concrete difference worth investigating; it has not established a safe storage method.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Staying healthy, learning through small real trials, and sharing useful findings without exhausting local supplies.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

